ing}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a\\in A\\;|\\{b\\in A:a\\to b\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FinitelyBranching}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a\\in A\\;|\\{b\\in A:a\\to b\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>要求每个元素的不同一步后继有限；不要求整个载体有限，也不预先要求统一的分支数上界。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ 为集合，$\\to\\subseteq A^2$；单关系ARS见 [[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\to\\subseteq A^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FinitelyBranching}(A,\\to)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall a\\in A\\;|\\{b\\in A:a\\to b\\}|<\\aleph_0.","display":true}],"bytes":1027,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-46","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-finitely-branching.md]]"}],"outgoing":["89129816153530db"]}